submission_format:
Return a JSON object with the same keys and nesting as the example below.

```json
{
  "artifacts": {
    "dataset": "/workspace/output/dataset.extxyz"
  }
}
```

Use the format below for the file `/workspace/output/dataset.extxyz`:
ASE .extxyz, with species, positions (Angstrom), pbc=false, energy (total eV) and forces (2,3; eV/Angstrom) in every Ag2 frame. The first frame's info.default_dtype may specify "float32" or "float64"; the default is "float64".
